# A user is a person who can sign in. A user is only a name and a language:
# how they prove who they are (addresses, a password, an authenticator
# app) is kept beside it and described by the namespaces that change it.
#
<%- if app.organizations? -%>
# A user may work in several organizations. The namespace is where a
# signed-in user asks the app who they are.
<%- else -%>
# The namespace is where a signed-in user asks the app who they are.
<%- end -%>
module Accounts::Users
end
